From 49bc99a7cc70b2bb52b10638a85f47542150bef2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 2ax4 <2ax4@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 00:22:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Offline build: the glass look keeps only the offline account

The top bar drops the Sign in with Microsoft button: the account chip
(who plays, and how) moves into its place, next to the settings button.

Settings' Account card drops the Microsoft card with its white button and
its glass plate: the offline account, its offline names and the skin panel
are the whole card, at the full width. The three strings the card alone
used go from every language table, as patch 0006's test asks.
